        "$2.23^2\\leq5<2.24^2$，",
        "即 $2.23^2<(\\sqrt{5})^2<2.24^2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，",
        "$2.23<\\sqrt{5}<2.24$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这样一来，我们又找到了小数点后有两个数字的两个连",
        "续的小数，而 $\\sqrt{5}$ 在这两个小数之间（图45，в）. $2.23$ 是 $\\sqrt{5}$ ",
        "的不足近似值，而 $2.24$ 是 $\\sqrt{5}$ 的过剩近似值."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "同样可以找到一个长度为 $0.001$ 且包含坐标为 $\\sqrt{5}$ 的点",
        "的区间：",
        "$2.236<\\sqrt{5}<2.237$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$2.236$ 和 $2.237$ 分别是 $\\sqrt{5}$ 的不足和过剩近似值."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这种计算可以继续进行下去. 如果讨论到上面这个不等",
        "式为止，那么我们可以取左右两个数的算术平均数作为 $\\sqrt{5}$ ",
        "的近似值，得：",
        "$\\sqrt{5}=2.2365\\pm0.0005$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "737",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
